2 CONC  dusty county roads on his bicycle seeking the support of councils in the project.
2 CONT A cairn erected in 1935 in his native Roseville is a monument to his participation in the enterprise. In 1953, Ontario Hydro named the transformer station at Petersburg after him. In 1918 he developed water power near Michipicoten
