2 CONT III. Joseph Wismer, bn. in Bucks Co., Pa., July 23, 1753; died in Chester Co., Pa., Aug. 30, 1820, aged 67 yrs., 1m., 7d. Married Barbara Wismer, daughter of Henry Wismer of Hilltown, Pa. ---. Farmer in Bedminster Twp. Children: E
2 CONC lizabeth, Barbara, Catharine, Esther, Henry, Henry, Joseph, Jacob, Mary, Anna.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT "On my mother's side there was a tradition that her grandparents [the Wismers] were of a German colony that settled in Virginia and were mostly destroyed by the Indians, and that her grandfather Wismer coasted in an Indian canoe t
2 CONC o Philadelphia [Letter from Amos Fowler Albright to Weston Goodspeed].
2 CONT
2 CONT After the Revolution, Henry Wismer took care of daughter Nancy's sons Henry & Jacob Root while she traveled with her second husband Francis Albright to Canada.  When Henry Root declared he wanted to move to Canada also, Wismer sai
2 CONC d he was glad of it as they had a good government there (as opposed to the new American one). "
2 CONT ******************************************************************************************************** This information was posted on another profile for Henry, though the death date in not the same. My sources have been History
2 CONC  of the Goodspeed Family, by AE Goodspeed, which is available for free download from the Library of Congress. Here is the other info: Henry Wismer   
2 CONT
2 CONT Son Of  Jacob Wismer, Sr. and Nanny Wismer (Souder/Oberholtzer)   Husband Of  Barbara Wismer (Lederach) and Barbara Wismer (Lederach)   Father Of  Abraham Wismer, Abraham Wismer, Annie Albright (Wismer), Barbara Wismer, Christian 
2 CONC Wismer and 6 others, Esther Funk (Wismer), Henry Wismer, Jacob Wismer, Jacob Wismer, Joseph Wismer and Mary Knipe (Wismer) « less   Brother Of  Abraham Wismer, Christian Wismer, Daniel Wismer, Elizabeth Wismer, Elizabeth Wismer an
2 CONC d 7 others, Jacob Wismer, Jr, John Wismer, Joseph Wismer, Mark Wismer, Mary Wismer, Nancy Kephart (Wismer) and Nanny Wismer « less  
2 CONT
