2 CONT Mary (Wismer) Knipe was the daughter of Henry Wismer and Barbara (Lederach) Wismer. She married Christian Knipe about 1781. This information is verified in the Records of Henry Wismer. Christian and Mary lived on a farm in Gwynedd
