2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth ROSENBERGER 
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 FEB 1748 - 7 AUG 1823
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: 9 FEB 1748, Hatfield Twp, Mont. Co PA [1632] [1633] 
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: 7 AUG 1823, Lower Salford, Mont. Co PA [1634] [1635] [1636] 
2 CONT
2 CONT BURIAL: Lower Salford Mennonite cem. 
2 CONT
2 CONT REFERENCE: Mel/drl/jmg 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Benjamin ROSENBERGER 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Helena 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : John D. ALDERFER 
2 CONT
2 CONT MARRIAGE: ABT. 1768 [59056] 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Ann "Nancy" R. ALDERFER 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Benjamin R. ALDERFER 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Frederick R. ALDERFER 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Joseph R. ALDERFER 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Abraham R. ALDERFER 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT  Elizabeth Rosenberger was born 7 FEB 1747/48 in Hatfield Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 7 AUG 1823 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. She was the daughter of 34. Benjamin Rosenberger and 35. Helena. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children of Elizabeth Rosenberger and John D. Alderfer are:    i. Helena Alderfer died 30 NOV 1836 in Franconia Mennonite, Franconia, Montgomery Co, PA. She married Michael Weirman. He died 30 AUG 1836 in Franconia Mennonite, Fra
2 CONC nconia, Montgomery Co, PA.  
2 CONT
2 CONT     ii. Elizabeth R. Alderfer was born 12 AUG 1785 in Lower Salford Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 25 JUN 1857 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     iii. John R. Alderfer was born 27 JUL 1789 in Lower Salford Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 10 JAN 1864 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.   iv. Abraham R. Alderfer was born 21 JUL 1782 in Lower Salford twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 27 MAY 1865 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. He married Susanna Shoemaker 1808, daughter of Michael Schumach
2 CONC er and Anna O. Hackman. She was born 10 MAR 1784 in Salford Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 30 AUG 1823 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. He married Anna (Nancy) Keely 1824, daughter of Conrad Keely. She was 
2 CONC born 12 JAN 1804 in Lower Salford, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 5 NOV 1890 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA.  
2 CONT
2 CONT     v. Frederick R. Alderfer was born 24 NOV 1773 in Salford, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 9 DEC 1854 in Providence Mennonite, Upper Providence, Montgomery Co, PA. He married Susanna S. Showalter 4 JAN 1798, daughter of Joseph Show
2 CONC alter and Magdalena. She was born 24 OCT 1776 in Chester Co, PA, and died 7 SEP 1807 in Providence Mennonite, Upper Providence, Montgomery Co, PA. He married Elizabeth Rosenberger 5 NOV 1807, daughter of David Rosenberger and Anna
2 CONC  C. Funk. She was born 17 AUG 1775 in Lower Salford Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 1821 in Upper Providence, Montgomery County, PA. He married Anna Frederick 12 JAN 1823 in Tohickon Reformed, Bedminster, Bucks Co, PA, daughter o
2 CONC f Joseph Frederick and Catharine. She was born 29 MAR 1785, and died 5 AUG 1863 in Providence Mennonite, Upper Providence, Montgomery Co, PA.  
2 CONT
2 CONT     vi. Mary R. Alderfer was born 15 FEB 1777, and died 1 JUN 1857 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     vii. Joseph R. Alderfer was born 11 OCT 1779 in Lower Salford Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 6 MAR 1863 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. He married Mary (Molly) Krout, daughter of Jacob Krout and Anna F
2 CONC reed. She was born 4 JUL 1788 in Bedminster, Bucks Co, PA, and died 12 OCT 1860 in Lakeview Cemetery, Susquehanna, PA. He married Hannah K. Kinsey, daughter of Johannes Kinsey and Susanna C. Kolb. She was born 5 SEP 1776, and died
2 CONC  12 SEP 1824 in Lower Skippack Mennonite, Evansburg, Montgomery Co, PA.  
2 CONT
2 CONT     viii. Anna (Nancy) R. Alderfer was born 13 MAR 1769, and died 17 MAY 1861 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. She married Henry C. Lederach, son of Henry C. Lederach and Catherine Clemmer. He was born 8 JAN 
2 CONC 1766, and died 4 SEP 1841 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA.  
2 CONT
2 CONT     ix. Benjamin R. Alderfer was born 3 OCT 1771 in Lower Salford Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 18 JUN 1840 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA. He married Elizabeth Schumacher 9 MAY 1794, daughter of Michael 
2 CONC Schumacher and Anna O. Hackman. She was born 10 OCT 1772 in Salford Twp, Montgomery Co, PA, and died 17 NOV 1840 in Salford Mennonite, Harleysville, Montgomery Co, PA.  
2 CONT
