2 CONT
2 CONT Emigrated to America before 1727 and settled on a tract of 150 acres in Salford Twp, (then Phila. Co.), Montgomery Co., PA. He acquired this tract before 1734. Judith was apparently his second wife, though the name of his first wi
2 CONC fe is not known to me. His will states that he had eight children, but the names of only five are known. Known as "Little Jacob", or Jacob of Salford.
