2 CONT ---
2 CONT email I received: Nancy Strome (nee Rosenberger) was my Great grandmother. Her daughter Elizabeth was married to Andrew G Mills. Elizabeth died after giving birth to a boy (Willie) in 1875. Willie died 5 days later and is interred
2 CONC  with Elizabeth. Her mother Nancy stayed with her son-in-law and helped to raise the 2 other children
