2 CONC 1786. 1.98 To wife Elisabeth, 800 pds. to be paid her 3 years after son Joseph is 2 1, they to live on farm with stock and implements, until he is 21. To s on Joseph farm and grist mill, 110 acres. He to pay 800 pds. and intere st
