1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cassel, Daniel Kolb(, b. 1820-?)  , A genealogical history of the Kolb, Kulp or Culp family: and its branches in America , 1895 Publisher: Norristown, Pa. : Morgan R. Willis  , pg. 155-156. "A genealogical history 
2 CONC of the Kolb, Kulp or Culp family : and its branches in America, with biographical sketches of their descendants from the earliest available records ...". "
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN OF No. 1205.  MARIA KOLB (Joseph Detweiler), of JACOB of Dillman 
2 CONT * 4 1245 I Johannes Detweiler, m. Catharine Funk, a daughter of Rev. Christian Funk, of Franconia, Pa. 
2 CONT * 4 1246 2 Jacob Dctzveiler, m. Maria Funk, evidently a daughter of John Funk, son of Heinrich (A. J. Fretz). 
2 CONT * Jacob Funk, of Indian creek, a cousin to John Funk, also had a daughter Maria about same age, and born and raised in  the near neighborhood of the Detweiler's. Might it not be more probable that it was the daughter of Jacob Funk
2 CONC  ?  D. K. Cassel.  
2 CONT * 4 1247 3 Sara Dctzveiler ; unmarried. 
2 CONT * 4 1248 4 Sitsanna Detzveiler, m. Martin Rittenhouse, son of Nicholas Rittenhouse and Sara Kolb ; res., Roxborough, Philadelphia. 
2 CONT * 4 1249 5 Elisabeth Detzveiler."
2 CONT
