2 CONT Aug 8 th, in Waterloo Co., Ont., Bro. Noah Schantz, aged 57 years and 6 months. He was removing a wall, when a portion of it fell upon him, and broke both legs, three ribs, and crushed in body considerably; although suffering excr
2 CONC utiating pain, he survived 5 hours. He leaves a wife and 9 children to mourn their loss. 
