2 CONT
2 CONT Allan was born and raised in Waterloo Township, where his father was a farmer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Allan married Sarah Heckendorn on February 16, 1904 in Elmira, Ontario. The marriage affidavit shows that Allan was a farmer in Woolwich Township. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah and Allan had a daughter, Luella (born May 22, 1905; died December 23, 2006). Luella was married to Harry Boyle (1896-1981).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah and a stillborn daughter died on April 15, 1910. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On June 28, 1911, Allan married Gilda Ann Saltzberry in Waterloo, Ontario. At the time of their wedding, Gilda already had a daughter, Ruth, as did Allan (Luella). The couple had five more children: Fred, Frank, Kenneth, Doris, an
2 CONC d Norman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Allan died in 1926 and was buried beside his first wife.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/200538972/allan-groff Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 1 2024, 0:16
