1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Henry emigrated in 1729 with his family. He settled Montgomery county, PA where he purchased 159 acres on the Indian Creek. Later in life, he donated land for the graveyard at the Franconia Mennonite meetinghouse.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Rosenberger of Pa. Genealogical record of the descendants of Henry Rosenberger of Franconia, Montgomery Co., by Rev. A. J. Fretz, 335p, 1906.
2 CONT
2 CONT In his book The Desc of Henry Rosenberger, A. J. Fretz believes the Henry is the first of the Rosenbergers from Germany to settle in Montgomery Co., PA
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT # ID: I031765
2 CONT
2 CONT # Name: Henry \ Heinrich Rosenberger 1
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sex: M
2 CONT
2 CONT # Birth: ABT 1680 in Europe (probably Zwiebrucken, Germany)
2 CONT
2 CONT # Death: BEF 1750 in Philadelphia Co (now Montgomery Co, ) PA - buried Franconia Menn Cem
2 CONT
2 CONT # Note: Arrived in PA abt 1729, in which year he purchased a farm in what is now F ranconia Twp, Montgomery Co, PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Barbara (nee unknown) Rosenberger b: AFT 1680
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Married: in Germany & resided Philadelphia Co, now Montgomery, Co, PA after 1729
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Anna Rosenberger b: BEF 1697
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Has Children Daniel Rosenberger b: ABT 1710 in Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Has Children Benjamin Rosenberger b: ABT 1712 in Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Has Children John Rosenberger b: 1 JUN 1724 in Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Has Children Henry Rosenberger , Jr b: 2 DEC 1725 in Germany (dob is old style)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Title: History of Bucks Co, William W.H. Davis, 1905 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Heinrich  immigrated to America between 1720-29 through Philadelphia,PA and was the first German Mennonite to come to Montgomery Co,PA. He bought land near Franconia,PA on 11/14/1729. Henrich donated some land for the Mennonite Me
2 CONC eting House and Cemetery.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-143932001-2-1451/henry-muller-rosenberger-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 21 2019, 2:
2 CONC 23:49 UTC''
2 CONT
