1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Barbara was the daughter of Michael & Ann(Rosenberger)Kolb of Montgomery County, Pennsylvania. Her mother, Ann was the daughter of Daniel and Fronica(nee?)Rosenberger. Daniel Rosenberger was the son of Heinrich "He
2 CONC nry" Rosenberger & Barbara(nee?). Henry Rosenberger was born, Nov 19, 1680 in Zwiebrucken, Germany and immigrated with his family in the 1720's to Hatfield, Montgomery, Pennsylvania. The Rosenberger family were of the Mennonite or
2 CONC  Anabaptist beliefs who had to flee their homeland and estate from persecution. (Daniel Rosenberger's Find A Grave Memorial# 76901604).
2 CONT
