2 CONC e Source:  PA ARCH, 6TH SER, VOL 1, PP 853, 855; 5TH SER, VOL 15, PP 438, 439 Service Description:  1) CAPT ANDREW CAMPBLE, 5TH BATT, PHILADELPHIA CO MILITIA 2) PAID SUPPLY TAX, 1780 
