2 CONT
2 CONT +Abraham R. ALDERFER 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT I have recently found out that I am a direct decendent of John Alderfer who served in The Revolution.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a book called " Alderfer's of America" in this book I am listed as daughter of Dr. Kenneth Groff Alderfer MD, born 11-20-63, although my birthdate is wrong in the book.
2 CONT
2 CONT I do not have access to the book at the moment, but I believe John Alderfer served in Pennsylvania, what is now Bucks County, Pa. I can find out the details. My grandfather was a member of the SAR, his name was Abram Alderfer.
2 CONT
2 CONT _____________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT I do see John Alderfer in the Patriot Index of the DAR. He was b- 2-8-1745 PA d- 12-19-1820 m to Elizabeth Rosenberger, he was a Private in PA.Try to find the local DAR Society, and they will help you fill out papers to become a m
2 CONC ember.
2 CONT
2 CONT _______________________________________________A search of our index provided the following entry.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALDERFER, John b 2-8-1745 PA d 12-19-1820 PA m Elizabeth Rosenberger Pvt PA
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely, Danette, Patriot Lookup Volunteer
2 CONT
2 CONT This is a free look up service provided by DAR volunteers at the DAR message board.___
