2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000002576578153&photo_id=6000000174927604851&position=0 '''Christening Record:'''	Feb 24 1689 in Griesheim, Offenburg, Freiburg, Baden-Württemberg, Germany.]
