2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna was the daughter of Jacob Meyer Jr. and wife Barbara. She married Yelles Cassel about 1717. Anna and Yelles had nine children: Elizabeth, Joseph, Mary, Johannes, Henry, Hupert, Catharine, Barbara and Isaac.* Reference: [https
