2 CONT Father 	Rev. Julius Cassel b. circa 1679, d. circa 1750
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother 	Anna Meyer b. 1689, d. 1755
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth M. Cassel and Rev. Heinrich V. Kolb had 11 children. Her married name was Kolb. Elizabeth M. Cassel was also known as Elizabeth B. Cassel. She was Mennonite. She was born in 1719 at Pfalz, DE. She was the daughter of Rev
2 CONC . Julius Cassel and Anna Meyer. Elizabeth M. Cassel was born on 7 October 1719 at Franconia Twp., PA, US. She immigrated on 16 October 1737; Came to Ammerica with parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT As of 10 May 1744,her married name was Kolb. She died on 18 June 1798 at Skippack, PA, US. She died on 29 April 1852 at Franconia Twp., PA, US.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 	Rev. Heinrich V. Kolb b. 1721, d. 1783
2 CONT
2 CONT Child 	
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Dillman C. Kolb+ b. 1753, d. 14 Dec 1785
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT conflicting info...may have been named Veronica
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT There are no records to indicate Elizabeth is buried in this cemetery, it is very possible as her husband and children are.  https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=77412971
2 CONT ----
