2 CONT
2 CONT Rev. Isaac CASSEL was born on Aug 21, 1746 in Skippack, Mongomery County, PA. He died on Sep 2, 1823. He was buried in Lower Skippack Cemetery, PA. Parents: Yelles (Julius) CASSEL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Barbara DETWEILER. Rev. Isaac CASSEL and Barbara DETWEILER were married on Oct 20, 1768. Children were: John CASSEL, Jacob CASSEL, Elizabeth CASSEL, Magdalene (Molly) CASSEL, Abraham CASSEL, Susanna CASSEL.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Book: "The colonial clergy of the middle colonies, New York, New Jersey..." ISAAC CASSEL, b. 21 Aug. 1746; sett. Skippack (Montg.) Pa., 1 774-1 823; Menn.; d. Skippack, Pa., 2 Sept. 1823.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd marriage to Magdalena Kolb on 8/3/1801, the daughter of Dillman & Wilhelmina Rittenhouse Kolb.  Source: Lancaster Mennonite Vital Records
2 CONT
