2 CONT ***************************************
2 CONT
2 CONT Tombstone picture doesn't make sense Last name appears to be different. Last name might be Stack.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was a widow in 1850 so the Jacob (Benner) Cassel who was born about 1783 was her husband. The other Jacob (Oberholtzer) Cassel was still around in the 1860 census, but his wife was Barbara (in 1850 and 1860), not Elizabe
2 CONC th. I sent an edit to disconnect the incorrect Jacob.
2 CONT
