1 NOTE {geni:about_me} RUDY.-In Wellesley township, Waterloo county, Ont., on the 23d of April, of heart disease, Bro. Benjamin Rudy, aged 52 years, 6 months and 10 days. Buried in the forenoon of the 25th at David Eby's church, Waterloo
2 CONC  township. A large number of relatives and friends assembled on the solemn occasion. Appropriate remarks were made by Noah Stauffer and Tobias Bowman, from Matt. 24:44, and Luke 13:35.
2 CONT ---
