2 CONT *Civil War Veteran Cornelius served as a Private with the 10 Michigan Cavalry Company-C. He enlisted on October 3, 1863 in Grand Rapids, Michigan. He was discharged on March 10, 1864. There is a brown book that says he died March 
2 CONC 10, 1864 in Somerset, Kentucky not sure why.
