1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/225980706/abraham-rosenberger-strome
2 CONT
2 CONT The date of birth shown above is from a death record. Ezra Eby (A Biographical History of Waterloo Township, 1895) gives March 21, 1833. ~~~~~~~ Abraham Strome was a carpenter by trade. He married Esther Martin on May 15, 1855. Th
2 CONC e couple had eight children (five died in infancy): - Jeremiah (1856-1894) - Menno (1857-1939) - Almeda (1859-1860) - Mary Ann (1861-1861) - Clara Melissa (1863-1888) - Merritt (1862-1862) - Christian (1864-1864) - Lydia Ann (1873
2 CONC -1873)
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther died on April 9, 1901.
2 CONT
2 CONT After Esther's death, Abraham, at age 70, married Lydia Faust (age 47) on September 22, 1903, in Zurich, Huron County, Ontario.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham died at the K & W Hospital in Kitchener, Ontario, on November 15, 1923. A death record noted that the cause of death was senility and bronchial pneumonia. His grave in First Mennonite Cemetery is unmarked.
