1 NAME Elizabeth Rosenberger /Strome/
2 GIVN Elizabeth Rosenberger
2 SURN Strome
2 _MARNM Mills
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC 	 Roseville Mennonite Cemetery Roseville, Waterloo Regional Municipality, Ontario, Canada
2 ADDR
