1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/115788598/elizabeth-mills
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was a daughter of John & Nancy Strome. She was born in Blenheim Twp; in Oxford County in the year 1844.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1851 census of Blenheim Twp; 1861 census of Blenheim Twp; 1871 census of Wilmot Twp;
2 CONT
2 CONT After marrying her husband Andrew G. Mills (1843-1885) sometime in the 1860's she gave birth to 3 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Anna M. Mills 1869/70- 2. John Ervine Mills 1872- 3. William "Willie" Mills 1875-1875.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sadly, Elizabeth died 7 days after giving birth to William. Her cause of Death was; Puerperal Fever from Child birth. She was only 31 years, 2 months and 1 day old. Death Register #008276.
2 CONT
2 CONT Five days later young William also died.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her Mother Nancy Rosenberger-Strome then went to live with her son-in-law Andrew to help raise Anna and John Mills.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gravesite Details Ezra Eby Book ID #7254.
