2 CONC ngers Glen Community, A Historical Sketch 1875-1975; Singers Glen, VA; Harrisonburg-Rockingham Historical Society, Dayton, VA. Immigration: 1786, > Rockingham Co., VA  Death: , Rockingham Co., VA , Occupation: Minister  Religion: 
