2 CONT 1718  December 20, land warrant to Heinrich Funck of Germantown for 101 3/4 acres on a branch of Perkeawming Creek. Later buys adjoining tracts. Total 201 acres. Also 166 acres "of ye Mannor Lands on ye upper part of a branch of P
2 CONC erkyoming", probably part of Perkasie Manor, Hilltown Twp, Bucks Co, PA willed to son Henry.
