2 CONT Henry Funk (son of Heinrich Funck and Anna Meyer) was born Abt. 1729 in Franconia Township, Montgomery Co., Pennsylvania, and died 1793 in Rockingham Co., Virginia. He married Barbara Showalter on Abt. 1760, daughter of Jacob Show
2 CONC alter and Mariah Saunders.
