2 CONC ifferences in beliefs concerning the Revolutionary War. This sect died out around 1850.
2 CONT *  [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000007835350745&photo_id=6000000197259327822&position=0 '''Rev. Christian Meyer Funk, Sr. is listed in Pennsylvania, U.S., Septennial Census, 1779-1863 for Christi
