2 CONC  and Susanna "Anna" Cassel (Meyer). Barbara Cassel, m. Christian Funk; he was born 1731 and married 1757, and was called to the ministry about the same time; he died May 31, 1811, in his 80th year, and is buried in Delp's graveyar
2 CONC d, in Franconia township, Montgomery county, Pa.; his wife Barbara died December 29, 1792.
