2 CONC e residents of what is now upper Montgomery County, and according to Dr. William J. Hinke this petition furnished a good census of the Perkiomen Valley. Many of the men who signed the petition were Mennonites including Hans Detwei
2 CONC ler who was the nineteenth of twenty-seven signatures on the petition to Governor John Roberts.
