1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 336. Jacob Detweiler, born 1710 in Franconia Twp., Montgomery Co., PA; died September 01, 1786 in Montgomery Co., PA. He was the son of 672. Hans Gregorius Detweiler and 673. Susannah ?. He married 337. Neltgen Van
2 CONC  Sintern Kolb July 25, 1738 in Franconia Twp., Montgomery Co., PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 337. Neltgen Van Sintern Kolb, born July 20, 1712 in Philadelphia, Philadelphia Co., PA; died in Montgomery Co., PA. She was the daughter of 674. Martin Kolb and 675. Mary Magdalena Van Sintern. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jacob Detweiler and Neltgen Kolb are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Magdelina Detweiler, born April 04, 1739; married Abraham Oberholtzer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Susanna Detweiler, born January 23, 1740/41; married Christian Meyer March 27, 1763; born January 29, 1727/28 in Montgomery Co., PA; died 1783 in Montgomery Co., PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Johannes Detweiler, born March 09, 1742/43; died 1817; married Barbara Moyer.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Sarah Detweiler, born October 17, 1745; married Christian Oberholtzer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 168 v. Martin Kolb Detweiler, born May 17, 1748 in Montgomery, Lycoming Co., PA; died November 24, 1819 in Gwynedd Twp., Montgomery Co., PA; married Maria Moyer 1770.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. Maria Detweiler, born March 01, 1750/51; died January 21, 1817; married Jacob Moyer.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. Hannah Detweiler, born March 23, 1754; died June 05, 1835; married Henry Oberholtzer.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. Elizabeth Detweiler, born May 07, 1757; died June 06, 1839; married John Moyer.
2 CONT
