2 CONT * ii.  GERTRAUT (#42456) was born in Gwynedd Twp. Montg. Co. Pa.. She married CHRISTIAN BERGEY date unknown. (CHRISTIAN BERGEY is #42458.) 
2 CONT * iii.  DILLMAN (#42457) was born in Gwynedd Twp. Montg. Co. Pa.. 
2 CONT * 104  iv.  HANNAH. 
2 CONT * v.  SARAH (#53966) was born in Gwynedd Twp. Montg. Co. Pa.. 
2 CONT * 105  vi.  CATHARINE ZIEGLER was born 1734 
2 CONT * 106 vii.  MICHAEL was born circa 1735 
2 CONT * 107 viii.  JACOB was born 16 April 1737 
2 CONT * 108  ix.  ISAAC was born circa 1743 
2 CONT * 109   x.  ELIZABETH was born 1748 
2 CONT * 110  xi.  SUSANNAH was born 1756 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born Abt. 1713 in Skippack Twp., Philadelphia Co Pennsylvania (now Montgomery County ), and died 1764.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Isaac Kolb:
2 CONT
