2 CONT
2 CONT Gotwals, William K. In Memory of William K.Gotwals .. Born Oct. 12 1838 .. Died Dec. 21 1915 .. Aged 77 Yrs. 2 Mo. 9 D.
2 CONT
2 CONT William K. Gotwals Birth: 12 OCT 1838 in Montgomery Co, PA Death: 21 DEC 1915 in PA - buried Methacton Menn Cem, Montgomery Co
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: John Gotwals b: ABT 1812 in Montgomery Co, PA Mother: Mary (nee unknown) Gotwals b: ABT 1811
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: His father is noted as having had 3 wives...
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Catherine E. Rittenhouse b: 9 NOV 1821 in Montgomery Co, PA Married: in PA & resided Worcester Twp, Montgomery Co in 1880
2 CONT
2 CONT ************************************
2 CONT
2 CONT The Lititz Record (Lititz, Pa.), Thursday, December 23, 1915, p. 1, col. 3: "Dead at Church of the Brethren Home -- The death of William Gotwals occurred at the Church of the Brethren Home, near Neffsville, on Tuesday morning at 7
2 CONC :30 o'clock. His age was 78 years and had been an inmate of the home for the past two years, coming there from Fairview Village, Montgomery county. He was a member of the Church of the Brethren for the past fifty years. Mr. Gotwal
2 CONC 's wife preceded him in death about two years ago and there are no surviving children. The body will be shipped to Fairview Village this morning and interment made at that place on Monday."
