2 CONT When William David Reesor was born on 11 August 1858, in Markham, York, Ontario, Canada, his father, Senator David Reesor M.L.A., was 35 and his mother, Emily McDougall, was 34. He married Alice A. Moffatt on 25 April 1883, in Pil
2 CONC ot Mound, Manitoba, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 1 daughter. He lived in Saskatchewan, Canada in 1916 and Maple Creek No. 111, Saskatchewan, Canada in 1926. He died on 29 October 1928, in Medicine Hat, Cypr
2 CONC ess, Alberta, Canada, at the age of 70.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/104065495/william-david-reesor Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 2 2022, 5:31:28 UTC'
