1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=16146762-6-109047&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-aad874d84df8b9bc34b3c53317713829&mrid=045156219c6713667e37
