1 NOTE {geni:about_me} GOSPEL HERALD - Volume LVII, Number 41 - October 20, 1964 - pp 925, 926                   Weber, Allan S., son of Joseph S. and Mary Ann (Shantz) Weber, was born at Waterloo, Ont., March 12, 1885, died at Kitchener
2 CONC , Ont., Aug. 24, 1964; aged 79 y. 5 m. 12 d. On Aug. 28, 1910, he was married to Sarah Martin, who died Nov. 11, 1934. On June 26, 1938, he was married to Johanna Eby Lichty, who survives. Also surviving are 7 children (Oliver, Sa
2 CONC muel, George, Alice-Mrs. Etril Snyder, Matilda-Mrs. Gordon Hunsberger, Clara-Mrs. Roy Snyder, and Florence), 5 brothers (Joseph, Newton, Orphen, Orval, and Byron), and 3 sisters (Hannah-Mrs. Herbert Snider, Violet-Mrs. Leonard Sni
2 CONC der, and Beulah-Mrs. Delton Schmitt). One son preceded him in death. He was a member of the Erb Street Church, where funeral services were held Aug. 27, in charge of J. B. Martin and Milton Schwartzentruber.
