2 CONC  1970; aged 65 y. 5 m. 16 d. On Feb. 21, 1931, she was married to Leonard G. Snider, who survives. Also surviving are 3 children (Marie Eileen, Edward, and Ruby-Mrs. Elroy Wideman), 3 grandchildren, 5 brothers (Joseph, Newton, Orp
