1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/190712724/edna-martha_marie-schippling
2 CONT
2 CONT Edna was born in the village of Wellesley, Ontario in 1912 to parents Albert & Elizabeth Becker. Birth Statement #503731.
2 CONT
2 CONT Later in life she became the wife of Frederick Adolph Schippling (1898-1954).
2 CONT
2 CONT Canada Voters List. 1935 Edna was single and living at 48 King St; East in Kitchener, Ontario.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1957 to 1974 Edna was now a widow and residing at 36 Willow St; in Waterloo, Ontario.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edna lived to the age of 83 years and 14 days.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Inscription
2 CONT * "Schippling
2 CONT * (A) Edna M. Schippling/ 1912-1995/ At rest/
2 CONT * (B) Frederick A. Schippling/ 1898-1954/ At rest/
2 CONT * (C) William J. Schippling/ 1892-1965/ At rest/
2 CONT * (D) Adolph Schippling/ 1855-1926/ At rest/
2 CONT * (E) Katherine Kalbfleisch/ his wife/ 1858-1930/ At rest/
2 CONT * (F) Emil Schippling/ 1894-1936/ At rest/
2 CONT * (G) Adam Schippling/ {Freemason compass and square}/ 1889-1974/ At rest/"
