1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Milne, Almeda, daughter of Aaron C. and Sarah (Bricker) Bowman, was born near Mannheim, Ont., May 27, 1890; died at K-W Hospital, Kitchener, Ont., Oct. 8, 1966; aged 76 y. 4 m. 11 d. On March 13, 1912, she was marr
2 CONC ied to George Milne, who survives. Also surviving are one son (Robert), 4 daughters (Alice - Mrs. Lloyd Cressman, Edith - Mrs. Earl Cressman, Jessie - Mrs. Howard Bearinger, and Gladys - Mrs. Donald Feick), one brother (Walter), 3
2 CONC  sisters (Mrs. Ward Mann, Mrs. Leslie Musselman, and Mrs. Eldon Musselman), and 27 grandchildren. One son (Donald) predeceased her in 1915. She was a member of the Mannheim Church, where funeral services were held Oct. 11, with Do
2 CONC nald Wenger officiating.
