1 NOTE {geni:about_me} KOEHN, June Irene (nee Shantz) Passed away peacefully at home after a lengthy illness, on October 22, 2013 at the age of 88. Predeceased by her loving husband Wally married to for 62 years, and her parents Edwin Sh
2 CONC antz and Rosetta Knorr. Loving mother of Greg Koehn (Bonnie), Karen Boegel (Brian), Cheryl Krauskopf (Jerry), Glenn Koehn, David "Grip" Koehn (Alice), Brian Koehn (Linda), and Debra Africh (Mike). Adoring grandmother of Tammy (Iai
2 CONC n), Cindy, Lisa (Wayne), Chad (Kim), Connie (Sean), Bob (Carry), Will (Jen), Kristy (Scott), Sam (Scott), Josh, Kim, Byron, Karrie and Melissa. Sister of Jean and sister-in-law of Dorthea. Predeceased by granddaughter Janice Kraus
2 CONC kopf (1972). Great-grandmother of Camden, Noah, Emily, Connor, Alex, Lauren, Alyssa, Wilhelm, Walter and Bradie, Tessa and Hannah. June was a proud member of the Royal Canadian Legion Branch #530. Friends may call at the Ratz-Bech
2 CONC tel Funeral Home , 621 King St. W., Kitchener, ON N2G 1C7 on Thursday, October 24, 2013 from 2-4 and 7-9 p.m. A Celebration of Life for June will take place on Friday, October 25, 2013 at 1 p.m. at the funeral home. Reception to f
2 CONC ollow. Thank you to Dr. Ward and the Palliative Care Team, to the St. Mary Heart and Function Clinic, to C.C.A.C., to Tamara, Erika, Gail, Jakie, Rose, and cousin Heather. Donations may be made to the Heart & Stroke Foundation or 
2 CONC the Canadian Mental Health Association. Visit June's memorial and share condolences online at www.ratzbechtelfuneralhome.com
