1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Buehler.- Ada, daughter of Albert and Anna (Shantz) Habermehle, was born in Woolwich Twp., Ont., Dec. 17, 1906; died at the K-W Hospital, Kitchener, Ont., Jan. 14, 1971; aged 64 y. 28 d. On Dec. 12, 1931, she was m
2 CONC arried to Norman Buehler, who survives. Also surviving are 3 sons (Floyd, Murray, and Vincent), one daughter (Verda-Mrs. Stanley Cook), 8 grandchildren, one brother (Leonard), and 7 sisters (Vera-Mrs. Eli Bauman, Edna, Erma-Mrs. E
2 CONC lvin Drudge, Ida, Beatrice-Mrs. Edward Feick, Alice-Mrs. Ralph Weber, and Doris-Mrs. William Ermel). She was a member of the St. Jacobs Mennonite Church, where funeral services were held on Jan. 17. in charge of Glenn Brubacher; i
2 CONC nterment in the Three Bridges Cemetery, St Jacobs, Ont.
