2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Has Children Mary Oberholtzer \ Overholt b: AFT 1725
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Has Children Barbara Oberholtzer \ Overholt b: ABT OCT 1726
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Has Children Sarah Overholt b: 30 SEP 1727 in Bucks Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. Has Children Magdalena Overholt b: ABT 1728 in Bucks Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    7. Has Children Esther Oberholtzer \ Overholt b: 16 MAY 1728 in Bucks Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    8. Has Children Jacob Oberholtzer \ Overholt b: BET 1730 AND 1736 in Bucks Co, PA
2 CONT
