2 CONT
2 CONT III. Jacob Wismer, bn. Dec. 3, 1751; died Apr. 18, 1837.  Mrd. Susan Delp, ---.  She was bn. about 1761; Dec. 15, 1827, aged 66 years.  Lived at Weavertown, and is known as "Weavertown Jacob."  Farmer.  Children: Mary, Catharine, 
