2 CONT
2 CONT IV. Elizabeth Wismer, bn. June 5, 1806; died June 15, 1875.  Mrd. Elias Wismer.  (See Index of References No. 78.)
2 CONT
2 CONT IV. Emanuel Wismer, bn. July 16, 1809; died Aug. 29, 1885.  Mrd. Elizabeth Angeny, ---.  She died fall of 1892.  Carpenter.  Menn's.  Children: Samuel, William, Abraham, Katy, Salome, Henry, John, Alfred, Hannah.
2 CONT
2 CONT IV. Aaron Wismer, bn. Jan. 13, 1812; died June 13, 1822.
2 CONT
