1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.myheritage.com/names/henrich_kephart
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrich ("Henry") Kephart, 1750 - 1845
2 CONT * Henrich ("Henry") Kephart, Sr. was born on month day 1750, in birth place, to John Johann George Kephart (born Gebhardt) and Elizabeth Gebhardt/Kephart (born Fretz).
2 CONT * John was born on February 11 1714, in Vielbrunn, Hessen-Harmst, Germany.
2 CONT * Elizabeth was born in 1722, in Northampton, Northampton, PA, USA.
2 CONT * Henrich had 12 siblings: Caleb Kephart (born Gebhardt), Adam Kephart (born Gebhardt) and 10 other siblings.
2 CONT * Henrich married Nancy "Nanny " (Oberholtzer) Kephart (born Wismer) circa 1765, at age 14 in marriage place, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT * Nancy was born on February 20 1743, in Carversville, Solebury Township, Bucks County, Pennsylvania, USA.
2 CONT * They had 15 children: Henry Kephart, Elizabeth Bazzel (born Kephart) and 13 other children.
2 CONT * Henrich lived in address.
2 CONT * He lived on month day 1795, in address, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT * He lived in 2 more places.
2 CONT * Henrich passed away on month day 1845, at age 95 in death place, Iowa.
2 CONT * He was buried in burial place, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ==brief biography==
2 CONT The man Henry was born about 1747 which indicates he was foreign born. His wife's name is not known. They were thought to have lived in Lancaster Co., PA where a couple of his boys were born. The father, Henry Kephart, died when t
2 CONC hese boys were six or eight years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
2 CONT * http://www.singingvoice.net/genealogy/histories/Kephart%20Family%20History.pdf
2 CONT
