1 NAME Jared T. /Preston/
2 GIVN Jared T.
2 SURN Preston
2 _MARNM Preston
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 MAR 1836
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lower Salford
3 STAE Pennsylvania
