1 NOTE 1. Obituary of JACOB FUNK RITTENHOUSE 
2 CONT Taken from Herald of Truth January 1895 
2 CONT
2 CONT RITTENHOUSE. _ On the 4th of December 1894, near Campden, Lincoln County, Ontario, of bronchitis, Brother Jacob Funk Rittenhouse, son of John Rittenhouse, aged 60 years, 1 month and 10 days. He leaves a sorrowing wife, two sons, t
2 CONC hree daughters and five brothers to mourn their loss, but they need not mourn as those who have no hope as he lived an exemplary life, in honesty and uprightness and Christian integrity. The remains were interred in the graveyard 
2 CONC at the Mountain M. H. in the presence of a large number of friends and relatives. Funeral services by Solomon Gehman from Heb. 2: 6. Peace to his ashes. 
