1 NOTE 1. Obituaty of JOHN WISMER MOYER 
2 CONT From Herald of Truth - April 15, 1891 
2 CONT
2 CONT MOYER. - On the 27th of March 1891, in Lincoln Co., Ont., of heart disease John W. Moyer, aged 70 years. Buried at the Mountain church on the 31st, where a large number of relatives and friends assembled to pay their last tribute 
2 CONC of respect to a dear brother and friend who was a good example to us all. He leaves a widow (his second wife) and nine children"all grown" to mourn his departure, but they need not mourn as such who have no hope. May God comfort a
2 CONC nd sustain the bereft ones in their deep affliction. Services by John F. Rittenhouse and Pre. Canada, from Num. 23: 10. 
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE of INFORMATION Mrs. Patricia High, Jordan Station, Ontario, Canada 
