1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Winder, Emmaline, adopted daughter of Benjamin and Nancy Sherk, was born Aug. 14, 1876, at Drumbo, Ont.; died after a brief illness, Aug. 22, 1959, at Kitchener, Ont.; aged 83 y. 8 d. She was married to Charles Win
2 CONC der, who died April 22, 1954. Surviving are a son (Harvey, Aurora, Ont.), 2 daughters (Bertha, Orilla, Ont.; and Ida-Mrs. Colin A. Saunders, Toronto), one grandson, and one great-grandson. She was a member of the First Mennonite C
2 CONC hurch, Kitchener. Funeral services were conducted at the Ratz-Bechtel Funeral Home, Aug. 25, in charge of Merle Shantz; interment in First Mennonite Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gospel Herald - Volume LII, Number 38 - September 29, 1959 - page 830, 831, 832
