1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gilda Ann was born in Wilmot Twp; in Waterloo County in the year 1876. Her Mother was Lovina Saltzberger (1855-1924). She was a Illegitimate child. Her Father was not named on her Birth Register #032103. Her Step-F
2 CONC ather was John Thomas Underwood (1863-1932).
2 CONT
2 CONT She was entered in the 1901 census of Blenheim Twp;
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilda also had a child out of wedlock named Ruth Saltzberry born in 1901.
2 CONT
2 CONT On June 28th, 1911 Gilda married a widower named Allan Groff (1869-1926) in the town of Waterloo, Waterloo County. She was 34 years old and he was 44 years old.
2 CONT Marriage Affidavit #014987.
2 CONT
