1 NOTE {geni:about_me} SNYDER, Gladys Ada -- Of 224 St. George St. Toronto, died February 26, 1985, at Toronto General Hospital, after a lengthy illness. Daughter of the late Abram and Lydia Ann (Groff) Snyder. Miss Snyder was a 1928 gra
2 CONC duate of the Toronto General Hospital School of Nursing, where she was a private duty nurse for many years. Latterly she was a nurse at Weston Sanitarium, Toronto. Predeceased by three brothers, Calvin, Fred and Herb and one siste
2 CONC r, Edith (Mrs. Clifford Scheifele). Survived by three sisters, Mary (Mrs. Vernon Snyder) of Cambridge, Lorraine (Mrs Alson Weber) of Kitchener and Dorothy (Mrs. Glen Ferguson) of Toronto.Cremation has taken place. A family memoria
2 CONC l service will take place.
