1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gospel Herald - Volume 82, Number 20 - May 16, 1989 - page 349, 350. Weber, Loraine Snyder, daughter of Abram Snyder and Lydia Ann (Groff) Snyder, was born at Waterloo, Ont., May 29, 1909; died of surgery complicat
2 CONC ions at Kitchener, Ont., Nov. 29, 1988; aged 79 y. On May 29, 1937, she was married to Alson M. Weber, who survives. Also surviving are 3 sons (James, John, and Ross). She was a member of Stirling Avenue Mennonite Church, where fu
2 CONC neral services were held on Dec. 1 in charge of Mary Mae Schwartzentruber and Steven Martin; interment in Parkview Cemetery.
