1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Arrived in Pennsylvania on the  "St. Andrew" on October 27,1738, listed under the name 'Christian Sauder'. No other family came on the ship with him (none are on the same list). Became a naturalized citizen of the 
2 CONC US on September 05, 1747. Purchased tract of land owned and occupied by Paul K. Fisher,near the Indianfield Lutheran Church on December 1, 1746
2 CONT --------------------
