2 CONT Birth: 1717 in Germany 3 Immigration: BET 1736 AND 1738 Souder Fam Hist has immigratiion as 9/1/1736 on the Harle of London. Another account (Desc of Christian Sauter) have immigration as 10/27/1738 on the St. Andres. 4 Event: Res
2 CONC ide(d) 01 DEC 1746 Bought 110 acres in Franconia. This land is now the present Indian Valley CC on Bergey Road. 4 Death: 1774 in Phila., PA 4
