2 CONT Jacob Nash Rosenberger was the son of Revolutionary War patriot Benjamin Rosenberger, Jr. In 1824 he married Elizabeth Kolb Detweiler, with whom he had five children, the last of which died at birth, followed by the death of Eliza
2 CONC beth. Jacob was married again in late 1839 or early 1840 to wife Mary Kulp.
