1 NOTE {geni:about_me} # ID: I010482
2 CONT
2 CONT # Name: Abraham D. Moyer
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sex: M
2 CONT
2 CONT # Birth: 18 MAR 1786 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT # Death: 9 MAY 1866 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT # Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     In a talk given on 5 Nov 1994 by Isaac Clarence Kulp, Jr., he stated th at it was not Abraham D. Moyer, but Abraham H. Moyer, who married Barba ra Landis, as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT     "Jacob H. Moyer, son of Jacob L. Moyer who was born in 1808 and died in 18 87, and of Sarah Heckler, who were Dunkards at Indian Creek. So I feel th at we Dunkards produced Jakie Moyer. Now he got mixed up on baptism someho w.
2 CONC  He got to doing it in the wrong direction, but at least he did it und er the water. He tells us in his autobiography that his mother died in 18 42 when he was just five weeks old, and then he went to be raised by his g randparent
2 CONC s who were Mennonite. And so his upbringing was Mennonite. His g randparents who raised him were Abraham H. Moyer and Barbara Landis. Abrah am H. Moyer was the son of Abraham Moyer and Catherine Hagey. So he h as a long history, a
2 CONC  long genealogical background of Mennonite and Brethr en forebears in the Franconia/Salford area."
2 CONT
2 CONT     At this time, I am unable to ascertain which Abraham Moyer actually marri ed Barbara Landis. As far as I've been able to determine, Abraham H. Moye r, son of Abraham D. & Catherine (Hagey) Moyer, was born about 1808 and ma rri
2 CONC ed Elizabeth (nee possibly Schueck), so I believe Isaac Clarence Kul p, Jr was in error about who "Jakie's" grandparents were.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Jacob * Moyer \ Meyer b: 4 NOV 1751 in what is now Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Maria "Mary" K. * Detweiler b: 1 MAR 1751 in what is now Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Barbara Landis b: 23 MAR 1788 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Married: ABT 1807 in PA & resided Franconia Twp, Montgomery Co in 1850 & 1860
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Jacob L. Moyer b: 26 SEP 1808 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Has No Children Catherine "Katie" Moyer b: in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Has Children Mary L. Moyer b: 25 JAN 1818 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Has Children Benjamin L. Moyer b: 28 AUG 1821 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Has Children Abraham L. Moyer b: 8 FEB 1823 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. Has Children Henry L. Moyer b: 19 JUN 1824 in Montgomery Co, PA
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
