2 CONT Landis, Lizzie Ann (Shoemaker), was born in Montgomery Co., Pa., Aug. 24, 1877; died at the home of her daughter Ida - Mrs. Elmer Kratz, Elroy, Pa., July 28, 1964; aged 86 y. 11 m. 4 d. On Sept. 10, 1897, she was married to Isaiah
2 CONC  M. Landis, who died in 1920. Surviving are 6 children (Elwood S., Jacob S., Isaiah S., Edith S. - Mrs. Howard F. Bergey, Amanda S. - Mrs. Titus M. Landis, and Ida S. - Mrs. Elmer Kratz), 24 grandchildren, 57 great-grandchildren, 
2 CONC and 3 great-great-grandchildren. Two daughters preceded her in death. She was a member of the Franconia Church, where funeral services were held Aug. 2, in charge of Leroy Godshall and Curtis Bergey.
2 CONT
