1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ROSENBERGER, Emery, son of Mr. and Mrs. Isaac Rosenberger, was born at New Dundee, Ont., Jan. 17, 1877; died at Fairview Mennonite Home, Preston, Ont., Feb. 23, 1966; aged 89 y. 1 m. 6 d. Surviving are a number of 
2 CONC nieces and nephews. He was a member of the Blenheim Church, where funeral services were held Feb. 26, in charge of Vernon Leis.
