2 CONT OBITUARY: Pottstown News, Pottstown, Pennsylvania, Monday, May 9, 1927. From Mike Osiol, Pottstown,Pa. Wilson A. Thomas, a native of Limerick, died on Saturday at his home of pneumonia. He was aged 63 years, 4 months, and 26 days.
2 CONC  The funeral will be held Wednesday afternoon at 2:30 o'clock, Daylight Saving Time. All services will be held at St. Luke's Reformed Church, Trappe, with interment in the adjoining cemetery. His wife preceded him in death five ye
2 CONC ars ago.
