1 NAME Mary Jane /Stauffer/
2 GIVN Mary Jane
2 SURN Stauffer
2 _MARNM Lackner
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Mount Hope Cemetery, Kitchener, Waterloo Regional Municipality, Ontario, Canada
2 ADDR
