1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/210018010/esther-strome
2 CONT
2 CONT The date of birth inscribed on the gravestone is February 17, 1831. However, May 29, 1831, is likely the correct date: The calculated date of birth using the inscribed death date and age information (69 years, 10 months, 11 days) 
2 CONC is May 29, 1831. This is the same birthdate recorded in Ezra Eby's A Biographical History of Waterloo Township and Other Townships of the County (1895). - With information from contributor Leland Rosenberger (49421439) ~~~~~~~ Est
2 CONC her was the seventh of thirteen children born to Christian and Esther (Stauffer) Martin. She was born and grew up in Woolwich Township, Ontario.
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther married Abraham Rosenberger Strome on May 15, 1855. Abraham was a carpenter. The couple had eight children (five died in infancy): - Jeremiah (1856-1894) - Menno (1857-1939) - Almeda (1859-1860) - Mary Ann (1861-1861) - Mer
2 CONC ritt (1862-1862) - Clara Melissa (1863-1888) - Christian (1864-1864) - Lydia Ann (1873-1873)
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther died on April 9, 1901.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription Esther Martin/ beloved wife of/ Abram R. Strohm [sic]/ born Feb. 17, 1831/ died April 9, 1901/ aged/ 69 yrs. 10 mos. 11 dys./ In that bright and glorious city/ we shall ever more abide
