1 NAME Sarah Etta /Strome/
2 GIVN Sarah Etta
2 SURN Strome
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 31 DEC 1872
2 PLAC Ontario
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 21 SEP 1878
2 PLAC Waterloo
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/93097744/sarah-etta-strome
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/213439944/sarah-etta-strome
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a monument memorializing Sarah Etta Strome in the Elmira Union Cemetery, Elmira, Ontario, the burial place of Sarah's parents. However, the older stone in the North Woolwich Mennonite Meeting House Cemetery indicates that
2 CONC  Sarah was actually buried there.
2 CONT -------
2 CONT Sarah Etta Strome was the third of ten children born to Aaron and Catherine Strome. She died when she was five years old due to a relapse of scarlet fever.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription In memory of/ Sarah Etta/ dau. of/ Aaron R. & Catherine/ Strome/ who died/ Sept. 21, 1878/ Aged 5 yr's. 8/ mo's. & 21 dy's./ A light is from our household gone/ a voice we loved is still'd/ a place is vacant at our hea
2 CONC rth/ which never can be filled
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
