2 CONT "Willie" was the infant son of Andrew G. Mills (1843-1885) and Elizabeth Strome (1844-1875). He was born & died in Wilmot Twp; Waterloo County. Birth Register #021533.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Willie" was only on this earthly world for 12 days. He is buried with his mother Elizabeth at Detweiler (Roseville) Mennonite Cemetery near Roseville in North Dumfries Twp; She died of a fever 5 days before "Willie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gravesite Details Ezra Eby Book ID #7258.
