1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/171449849/isaac-samuel-lautenschlager
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac was born in Waterloo Twp; in 1865 to parents Jacob Lautenschlager (1837-1930) and Elizabeth Rosenberger (1841-1880).
2 CONT
2 CONT He became the husband of Mary Ann Schweitzer on October 13, 1886 in Berlin, Ontario. Marriage Register #011823.
2 CONT
2 CONT * They raised 3 sons in Waterloo County.
2 CONT * 1. Stanton Lautenschlager 1888-
2 CONT * 2. Roy Lautenschlager 1889-
2 CONT * 3. Earl Lautenschlager 1906-
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
2 CONT Canada Voters List. 1940 residing with his wife at 188 Benton St; East in Kitchener.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Death Certificate #037566.
2 CONT * Cause of Death; Carcinoma of the Liver.
2 CONT * Birth Date; Jan. 10, 1864.
2 CONT * Death Age; 79 years, 3 months and 28 days.
2 CONT * Death Location; 188 Benton St; Kitchener.
2 CONT * Date of Burial; May 10, 1943.
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription Father/ Isaac S. Lautenschlager/ 1864-1943/ At rest/
