1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/215462882/john-wanner-groh
2 CONT
2 CONT John Groh was first married to Magdalena Rosenberger, and after her death, to Elizabeth Lehman. The children from his first marriage were Sivina Lauretta and Mary Elizabeth, and from his second marriage, Orville Irvin and Franklin
2 CONC  Edward.
2 CONT --------
2 CONT Newspaper Death Announcement Word has been received of the death of Rev. John W. Groh, who passed away last evening at the home of his son, F. E. Groh, 129 Longwood road, Hamilton. The late Rev. Groh. was a brother of Anson Groh a
2 CONC nd ex-reeve C. T. Groh, Preston-Hespeler road and had resided in that neighborhood, for many years. - Kitchener Daily Record, November 5, 1938
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription Groh/ Elizabeth Lehman/ Wife of John W. Groh/ Died Aug. 11, 1921, aged 71 yrs./ John W. Groh/ Died Nov. 4, 1938/ aged 89 yrs./ At rest/
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT John Groh was first married to Magdalena Rosenberger, and after her death, to Elizabeth Lehman. The children from his first marriage were Sivina Lauretta and Mary Elizabeth, and from his second marriage, Orville Irvin and Franklin
2 CONC  Edward.
2 CONT --------
2 CONT Newspaper Death Announcement
2 CONT  Word has been received of the death of Rev. John W. Groh, who passed away last evening at the home of his son, F. E. Groh, 129 Longwood road, Hamilton. The late Rev. Groh. was a brother of Anson Groh and ex-reeve C. T. Groh, Pres
2 CONC ton-Hespeler road and had resided in that neighborhood, for many years. 
2 CONT - Kitchener Daily Record, November 5, 1938* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/215462882/john-wanner-groh Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 23 2023, 1:28:46 UTC'
