1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/19441882/mary-elizabeth-clemens
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary, Kitchener-Waterloo Record 6 Mar 1957 pg 7: Mrs. Elizabeth Clemens - PRESTON, Mrs. Elizabeth Clemens, 79, died at Fairview Mennonite Home, here today, after a heart attack. She was ill only 24 hours. Daughter of the late 
2 CONC John W. Groh and Rosetta Rosenberger of Kitchener, she was born in Michigan, but spent most of her early life in Kitchener. After marriage, she moved to Sedgewick, Alta , where her husband died, 20 years ago. Mrs. Clemens, came to
2 CONC  Preston, four years ago, after spending five years in Toronto. She is survived by two brothers, Orville I. Groh, RR 2, Preston and Franklin E. Groh, Hamilton and by a sister, Mrs. Saline Dunekel, Wilhamston, Mich. The body is at 
2 CONC the H. K. Stager Funeral Home, where Rev. H. J. Herlihey will conduct the funeral, Friday, at two o'clock. Burial will be at Wanner Cemetery.
