1 NOTE {geni:about_me} County records state that Katie was 5 months, 12 days old when she died of cholera infantum. She was the daughter of Catherine and Thomas (Theron) Pelton. Inscription: Per cemetery records, in 1929, the headstone w
2 CONC as too difficult to read with what light was available. Recently in 2010, member Rick W looked for the headstone and found nothing. The headstone of Katie Pelton has possibly disintegrated. Photo provided on memorial is that of th
2 CONC e Pelton family grave area.
