1 NAME Martha /Ruth/
2 GIVN Martha
2 SURN Ruth
2 _MARNM Kriebel
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Souderton Mennonite Church Cemetery, Souderton, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 JUL 1885
1 DEAT
2 DATE 16 AUG 1959
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/77242607/martha-kriebel
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Kriebel, daughter of the late John and Mary (Rickert) Ruth, was born July 25, 1885, in Bucks Co., Pa.; died of a cardiorenal illness Aug. 16, 1959, at the home of her son, Warren, Souderton, Pa.; aged 74 y. 22 d.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married in 1907, to Frank C. Kriebel, who died in 1929.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving were 2 sons and 2 daughters (Abram, Collegeville; Warren, Souderton; Mary-Mrs. Norman Benner, Telford; and Sarah-Mrs. Edwin Fels, Quakertown, PA), 19 grandchildren, one great-grandchild, 2 brothers (Israel of Howard, Pa.
2 CONC ; and Jacob, Colmar, Pa.), and one sister (Elizabeth Hange, Line Lexington, PA).
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a member of the Souderton Mennonite Church where funeral services were in charge of Jacob M. Moyer, assisted by R. B. Musselman and A. D. Ruth.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Kriebel, daughter of the late John and Mary (Rickert) Ruth, was born July 25, 1885, in Bucks Co., Pa.; died of a cardiorenal illness Aug. 16, 1959, at the home of her son, Warren, Souderton, Pa.; aged 74 y. 22 d. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married in 1907, to Frank C. Kriebel, who died in 1929. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving were 2 sons and 2 daughters (Abram, Collegeville; Warren, Souderton; Mary-Mrs. Norman Benner, Telford; and Sarah-Mrs. Edwin Fels, Quakertown, PA), 19 grandchildren, one great-grandchild, 2 brothers (Israel of Howard, Pa.
2 CONC ; and Jacob, Colmar, Pa.), and one sister (Elizabeth Hange, Line Lexington, PA). 
2 CONT
