1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/13524797/agnes-s-hackman
2 CONT
2 CONT HACKMAN, AGNES S., daughter of the late deacon Henry and Susan (Swartz) LAPP, was born in Hilltown Twp., Bucks Co., Pa., June 25, 1883; died at the home of her granddaughter in Lansdale, Pa., Sept. 16, 1968; aged 85 y. 2 m.. 21 d.
2 CONC  Her husband, Irvin C. Hackman, died in 1950. Surviving are 2 granddaughters (Mary Jane--Mrs. Clarence Kratz, Jr., and Ruth Ann Zielger), one brother (Dr. Walter Lapp) and one sister (Mrs. Stella Frederick). She was a member of th
2 CONC e Line Lexington Church, where funeral services were held, with Floyd Hackman and Harvey Bauman officiating.
