2 CONT Delp, Mary (nee Lapp), was born Dec. 2, 1878; died Nov. 14, 1966; aged 87 y. 11 m. 12 d. She was married to Abram K. Delp, who preceded her in death in August, 1939. Surviving are 2 daughters, 2 sons, 9 grandchildren, and 24 great
2 CONC -grandchildren. One son and one daughter also preceded her in death. She was a member of the Plains Church. Funeral services were held at the Eastern Mennonite Home, Nov. 16; interment in Plains Cemetery.
