2 CONT Rev Christian Meyer BIRTH	1705 Netherlands DEATH	1787 (aged 81–82) Franconia, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA BURIAL	 Delps Cemetery Harleysville, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA MEMORIAL ID	13836342 · 
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Christian (DOB 1676) and Barbara Bergey Meyer (DOB 1676), he was married to Magdelena Veronica Bechtel (1705-1787) in 1727. He was a farmer and a Mennonite minister, having founded the Mennonite Church of Salford, Pennsylva
2 CONC nia. He was the father of nine children: Jacob (1730-1778), Samuel (1734-1800), Christian (1728-1783), Anna (1736-1812), Maria (1738-1857), Fronica (1739-1740), Esther (1742-1780), Barbara (1744-1823), and Esther (1735-1735).
2 CONT
