2 CONT 8. Lancaster County Recorder of Deeds (R-711) Deed signed 30 Nov 1748 (registered 14 Jan 1786) between (i) Abraham Myer of the Borough of Lancaster in the County of Lancaster in the Province of Pensilvania and (ii) Magdalena Witmo
2 CONC re of the same place.
