1 NOTE Following taken from:
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants and Associated Families of Johann Fernburg
2 CONT Entries: 27644    Updated: 2004-11-22 20:43:12 UTC (Mon)    Contact: Jan Farrenburg  
2 CONT
2 CONT START:
2 CONT
2 CONT ! Records found in TIB.
2 CONT Submitted by Daniel B. Funk and Victor Stonewall Showalter. Ordinances were done twice. Other dates: Bapt. 19 Jun 1945 SL
2 CONT End. 7 Nov 1946 SL IN #SL21168
2 CONT
2 CONT ! Church Rec: REF:F857645 S/N:OO321-6 MFID:00934139 LDS GEN DPT
2 CONT ! Misc. Rec: "Hott Ancestors" 1984, by Richard & Kathryn Hott.
2 CONT Barbara Showalter married Henry Funk Jr. She was the daughter of Jacob Showalter and Mariah Saunders. The DAR has perserved a little cemetery in the town of Cementon, Pa where Jacob is supposed to be buried. Charles Roberts wrote,
2 CONC "Jacob Showalter is buried in a small cemetery in the burough of Northampton across the river from Cementon, but has no tombstone".
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis Jobson gives the years 1734-1735 as her birth. He also states, "We have completed it (her line) genealogically, some of it to the present (1966). Also, we have compiled much of the Haldeman lines into which this and other 
2 CONC Showalter lines married."
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara was 91 years old when she died.
2 CONT
2 CONT END:
