2 CONT Name: Johannes SHOWALTER Given Name: Johannes Surname: Showalter Suffix: (John) (S-Garver-Funk) Title: (John) (S-Garver-Funk) Sex: M Birth: 1732 in Schafbusch, Geisberg, Germany Death: Mar 1805 in Tredyffine Twp., Chester Co., PA 
2 CONC Burial: Mar 1805 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT *Came to America in 1750, from Rotterdam, with his father Jacob Showalter.
2 CONT *They landed in Philidelphia, and went to Northampton County, Pa. John sold his land, 1 Apri l 1771, to Christopher Kern, and moved to Williamstown Twp. Chester County, Pa. The Will st ates the location as, Willstown. It is just e
2 CONC ast of West Chester, Pa. There is a Williamstow n, but it is in Paradise Twp. Lancaster Co. Pa.
2 CONT *John's son, John, lived about 13 miles west of Philadelphia. That location would best fi t the location of Willstown.
2 CONT **In 1779 he was reported as having 194 acres, and in 1781, 109 acres.
2 CONT     Records of: Floyd Howes, pg 18.
2 CONT     Preston Showalter,Mina Murdock
2 CONT     1790 Census, Tredyffrin Twp. Pa. page 49, line 16.
2 CONT     Will Book L, vol.II, pg 130. Tedyffrin, Chester Co. Pa. Signed 19 Feb 1803 and Probate 15 Fe b 1806.
2 CONT     Provides for his wife, Esther. Son, David, received the plantation which he, John and Esthe r were living on, and a tract of wood land in Willstown. This at a cost of L1400. The Estat e is divided equally among all the childre
2 CONC n in equal shares.
2 CONT     Exrs. Daniel and David Showalter
2 CONT     Wits. Matthias Pennebecker and Elijah Funk.
2 CONT     Signed in German
2 CONT     Victor Stonewall Showalter gave Johns name as it appeared on the passenger list as Johannes.
2 CONT * John was a gunmaker during the revolution.
2 CONT **Elaine Henderson of Hot Springs, Arkansas states that John was a Mennonite Minister.
2 CONT *DAR records sent by Mrs Katherine Haldeman Baldridge #206649 on Haleman, also O'Neil, and Showalter families.
2 CONT     F857645 S/N:00311-3 MFID:00934134 LDS GEN DPT
2 CONT     LDS GEN DEPT REF:F857645 S/N:00311-3
