2 CONC hter (md Isaac Williams)." 1966.
2 CONT     D.A.R. Patroit Index, 1966, page 614. Patriotic service
2 CONT     Record of Mrs. Carl (Mary C.) Cheek of Honey Creek, Henry Co., IN.
2 CONT
