2 CONT Maria Magdalena “Mary” Van Sintern Kolb BIRTH	1687   Probably born in Holland.  DEATH	1771 (aged 83–84) BURIAL	Lower Skippack Mennonite Cemetery, Skippack, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA  MEMORIAL ID	81773705 ·
