2 CONT Wife of Rev. Martin Kolb, 1680-1761.
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Maria Magdalena (Van Sintern) Kolb was probably born in the Netherlands in about 1688 and died in what is now Montgomery Co, PA sometime after November 1761, as she was the co-executor of her husband's will, along with her son Die
2 CONC lman Kolb, which was proven 17 Nov 1761.
