2 CONT Isaac was born c.1744. His burial place is unmarked but he died in Moore Twp. and is probably buried at the Settlement Mennonite Cemetery in Kreidersville.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is considerable confusion about the two Isaac Kulp cousins, sons of brothers Isaac and Henry and grandsons of Jacob & Sarah (Van Sintern) Kolb. Many family trees have Isaac Kulp 1750-1828 as the son of Isaac & Gertrauta (Zie
2 CONC gler) Kolb but this is not correct according to the Kulp family genealogy.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Isaac Kulp who died in 1828 is the proven husband of Rachel Jansen/Johnson of Gwynedd Twp. based on his estate records. This Isaac is #1240 in the Kulp Family History, son of Henry and Elizabeth (Cassel) Kulp. The children lis
2 CONC ted in his 1828 estate match the children of #1240 Isaac as provided in the Kulp Family History.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac son of Isaac & Gertrauta is #1212 in the Kulp family history which shows him as being born between Michael (1739) and Elizabeth (1748) so therefore born c.1744. This Isaac died in Moore Twp. in 1819 - his will was probated i
2 CONC n Northampton Co. on 7/6/1819. The children in his will match closely to the children listed for #1212 Isaac in the Kulp Family History. According to the Kulp Family History, this Isaac married Catharine Meyer (daughter of Peter M
2 CONC eyer of Springfield).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
