2 CONT Sarah Kolb m ______  ______ it is said that she had a daughter Margaret b. May 11, 1779 who married Abraham High/Hoch of Canada, and had one child, Maria b. March 7, 1815 who married Bishop Dillman Moyer of Canada  https://www.fin
