2 CONT
2 CONT There is speculation that Sarah and Susanna might be one and the same as many trees have Susanna married to Jacob Grater Meyer Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT KULP book page 152 sister Susanna Kolb listed as having married Michael Meyer first then Jacob Houser and had 7 children with Jacob Houser.  Many family trees have Susanna married to Jacob Grater Meyer as her first husband.
2 CONT
