2 CONT 2.Sarah married Jacob Grater Meyer  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/204527033/jacob-meyer
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Susan married Michael Dierstine Meyer (brother to Jacob different mother)  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/204527828/michael-meyer
2 CONT Michael was born about 1762. His will was dated 9/1/1780 and probated on 8/5/1782 along with the wills of his father Jacob Sr. and brother Jacob Jr. Michael does not have a marked burial place but it is likely that the unmarked fi
2 CONC eldstone next to Jacob Jr. is Michael's burial place.
2 CONT
2 CONT Both brothers died around the same time.  The bio states different years than the FAG for these 1/2 brothers but both around the same time.
2 CONT Under fathers bio states both Michael and Jacob died 1782 FAG states 1780
2 CONT He was a Mennonite minister and died of yellow fever. He was the father of ten children, three with Mary and seven with Barbara: Christian (1751-1826), Jacob (1753-1782), Maria (1754-?); Barbara (1770-?), Michael 1762-1782), Agnes
2 CONC  (1764-1835), Samuel (1765-1847), Samuel (1767-1844), Joseph (1774-1815), and David (1777-1850).
