2 CONT Will Abstract: Michael Dirstine of Rockhill, Miller. February 8, 1777. Proved January 2 3, 1782. Son Isaac and son-in-law Jacob Meyer, exrs. Son Abraham. Grandson Micha el Dirstine, son of son Jacob, December'd. Daus. Barbara wife
2 CONC  of Jacob Me yer, Elizabeth wife of Samuel Delp, Sarah wife of Peter Seller, and Hann ah Dirstine. Wit: Lewis Stannert, John Stannert.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Michael was an immigrant from Germany.  He married Agnes Kolb, 18 Jan 1734, in Skippack, PA.  Their children were: Sarah, Jacob, Michael, Barbara, Elizabeth , Isaac, Abraham, Sarah (again), Maria, Catharine, Maria and Johanna.  He
2 CONC  worked as a Miller.  His religion was Mennonite. .  He was the son of Samuel and Barbara Derstine.  His last name has been spelled many ways, one kind of spelling being Dierstein. Inscription: Michael Derstein Jun 6, 1777 64y11m6
