2 CONT
2 CONT Valentine was the original progenitor of the Hunsicker family and resided in Skippack Twp., Montg. Co., Pa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married his first wife whose name is unknown. They had two children and she died in childbirth. Their children were Elizabeth and Samuel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Valentine married secondly Elizabeth Kolb and had seven children: Jacob, Isaac, Sarah, Valentine (died young), Catherine, Abraham (died young), and Henry. I trace my lineage through three of their children, namely Isaac, Sarah and
2 CONC  Henry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Valentine's parents were Samuel Hunziker and Catherine Bar Klemmer.
2 CONT
2 CONT I am adding information that was part of another Valentine Hunsicker addition so it will be available too.
2 CONT
2 CONT Accompanied his grandfather, Bishop Valentine Clemmer, to America in 1717. He was one of the founders of the Mennonite congregation at Skippack.
