2 CONT Will Abstract: HUNSICKER, VALENTINE. Perkioming. Phila. Co. Farmer. March 21, 1768. M ay 3, 1771. Wife: Elizabeth, Children: Henry, Jacob, Samuel, Isaac, Sarah, Catherin e, Elizabeth. Grandchildren: children of daughter (Elizabeth
2 CONC ). Sons in la w: Gottshalk Gottshalk, Gerhard Clemens. Execs.: Elizabeth and Jacob Hunsi cker. Witnesses: Isaac Kolb, Dielman Kolb. (P:95)
