1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NOTE  Sarah Detweiler High (Hunsicker) was only married to one John High.      FAG has her married to John Gotwals High and  Kulp book has her married to John Ziegler High
2 CONT Son of Henry Schweitzer High (Hoch) and Catherine High-Hunsicker (Ziegler)
2 CONT Census for John Z High attached to his about section and will of his father attached to Henry Schwitzer High.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also note that on the fathers will there is a David High as a witness to Henry Schweitzer's will and in the will of David High he does not name John High as a beneficiary even though John was living at the time so at this point it
2 CONC  is believed that the FAG is incorrect and that John Z High went to live with David High family when his father passed away
2 CONT
2 CONT There is also a disconnect with dates the census shows that John was born around 1811  one family record shows he was born 1809
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 504 Kulp family book under John's mother Catherine High-Hunsicker
2 CONT Her son John married Sarah Hunsicker
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine Johns mother married Sarah Hunsickers father
2 CONT
