2 CONC  24, acting as housekeeper. It appears that the sister of CATHERINE, MARY ANN DOUGHTY, age 20 is hired as a servant. Her 2 year old son JAMES DOUGHTY is also living with them. All this is found in the Philadelphia 1860 Census Roll
