1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There are 9 children listed in the Kulp Family book for this family  - There is not a Jonathan - Harrison - Charles or Maria listed These 4 children posted by Zoe Tom belong to Daniel Umsted family
2 CONT
2 CONT Provided by Zoe Tom (#47000374)  
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Thomas UMSTED b: 22 FEB 1768
2 CONT Mother: Elizabeth RITTENHOUSE b: 18 MAR 1779 in Roxborough Township, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Maria RITTENHOUSE b: 06 APR 1803 in Roxborough Township, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania
2 CONT Married: 07 JAN 1827
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT Jonathon UMSTED  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/102417294/jonathan-rittenhouse-umsted
2 CONT Harrison UMSTED  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/141015499/harrison-benner-umstead
2 CONT Charles S. UMSTED   https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/158159671/charles-s-umstead
