2 CONT
2 CONT  A brief History of Bishop Henry Funck and other Funk Pioneers:gives the following on page 71: "VI. Anna Schatz, bn. Oct. - 1835. Mrd. John Overdorf. Farmer. Menn. Children: Fannie, Charles. VII. Fannie S. Overdorf, bn. Oct. 27, 1
2 CONC 851. Married Jacob L. Moyer. He was bn. Aug. 28, 1841, P.O., Bergey, Pa. Farmer. Menn. Children: Ella (1872), Emanuel (1874), Henry (1876), John (1877), Lizzie 1878), Mahlon, Anna, Jacob, Fannie, Harvey." Lizzie's grave marker giv
2 CONC es her dates as 1880-1944. Jacob O. Moyer's marker provides 1887-1979 and his draft card says 1888. Other markers: Annie (Moyer Rittenhouse Cressman) 1884-1980, Harvey 1891-1986 and another son, Melvin, !893-1895. Added by Wayne D
2 CONC avid Detwiler
