2 CONT Name	Esther Ann Bergey
2 CONT [Esther Ann Detweiler]
2 CONT Gender	Female
2 CONT Race	White
2 CONT Death Age	61
2 CONT Birth Date	24 May 1862
2 CONT Birth Place	Pennsylvania
