1 NOTE 1. CATHARINE BEYER RITTENHOUSE, wife of WILLIAM GOTWALS was living in Worcester Township, Montgomery County, Pa. in 1880. Her husband was a farmer and her mother RACHEL BEYER, age 84 was living with them. Found in Montgomery Count
2 CONC y 1880 census Roll 1159 Book 1 Page 261. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. In 1885 RACHEL BEYER died and so CATHARINE purchased the house and land from her mother's estate for $3,800. This is found in Orphan's Court File OC 15,106
