2 CONT Bellingham Herald
2 CONT Bellingham, Washington
2 CONT Monday, 30 November 1964
2 CONT Page 3, Column 3
2 CONT
2 CONT Bruce Reesor, 78, Burlington, Dies
2 CONT
2 CONT BURLINGTON - Services for Bruce Reesor, 78 (b. 1886), a retired Great Northern telegrapher, will be held at 1 p.m. Tuesday at Hulbush Funeral Home with burial to follow in Burlington Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Reesor died in a Sedro Woolley hospital Saturday.  He had lived in Burlington since 1925 and was a member of Melrose Lodge 62, F&AM of *Balth [Bawlf], Alberta, Canada.  He was also a member of Scottish Rite.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by the widow, Clarrissa; a daughter, Mrs. Evelyn Vyreck of Vancouver, B. C.; three brothers, Harry of Saskatoon, Sask; W. C. of Medicine, Hat., Alta., and Frank of Walsh, Alta.; five step-daughters, Mrs. Donna Graff
