2 CONC wkesville. Mother-in-law of Ion Martin of West Montrose. Also survived by twelve Grandchildren and twenty-six Great-grandchildren and sisters-in-law Rebecca Martin of Millbank and Hannah Martin of St. Jacobs. Predeceased by her pa
2 CONC rents Allan and Lovina (Hoffman) Bauman, her husband David B. Frey (2004), one son Amsey Frey (1984), one daughter Lydia (2008), one Great-grandson Jason Martin (2003), four brothers and three sisters. Friends may call at her home
2 CONC , R.R.#1, Wallenstein on Wednesday, October 12, 2011 (Today) from 2-7 p.m. where family service will be held on Thursday, October 13, 2011 at 9:00 a.m. then to South Peel Mennonite Meeting House for further service and burial in t
2 CONC he adjoining cemetery. Arrangements entrusted to the Dreisinger Funeral Home , Elmira.
