1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ephraim Hoffman
2 CONT
2 CONT Passed away peacefully at the KW Health Centre of the Grand River Hospital on Saturday, December 10, 2005 at the age of 90 years. Eph was a resident of Bankside Terrace in Kitchener. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Beloved husband for 63 years of Naomi (nee Martin).
2 CONT
2 CONT Loving father of Don and his wife Cheryl of Kitchener, Phyllis and her husband Gerry Schmidt of Parry Sound, and Larry (predeceased) and his wife Wendy of Waterloo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Proud and loving grandfather of Brett Hoffman and his wife Felicity, Travis Schmidt and his wife Cheryl, Donna and her husband Eoin McKenna, Erin, Adam, and Jordan Hoffman, and great-grandfather of Dylan, Dawson, and Eoin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Predeceased by his parents, Daniel Hoffman and  Maryann Bauman, two brothers and 5 sisters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eph farmed for many years in the Breslau area and was a partner of the Kitchener Stockyards and Waterloo Stockyards. He was a long-time member of Breslau Mennonite Church.
