1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Martin, Enos B. ~ Passed away peacefully at his residence on Sunday, February 8, 2015, at the age of 91 years. Enos Martin, of RR 1, Elmira, is survived by his wife Barbara and is remembered by many nieces and neph
2 CONC ews. He was predeceased by his first wife Elvina (Brubacher) Martin, parents Seth and Elizabeth (Bauman) Martin, and siblings Ezra (Marion), Abram (Rebecca), Menno (Amelia), Ephraim (Edna), Lovina (Noah) Bowman, Sarah (Isaac) Knor
2 CONC r, and Barbara in infancy. Visitation will be held at the home of Arnold Bowman, 8047 Reid Woods Drive, RR 1, Elmira, on Monday from 2-5:30 p.m. and 6:30-8:30 p.m. and Tuesday 1-5 p.m. A family service will be held at the home of 
2 CONC Peter Brubacher, 91 Henry Street, RR 1, St. Jacobs, on Wednesday, February 11, 2015 at 9 a.m., then to Conestoga Mennonite Meeting House for burial and public service.
