1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gospel Herald - Volume 80, Number 34 - August 25, 1987, page 614.                                            
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin.- Vera Bearinger, daughter of David and Elvina (Shantz) Bearinger, was born in Waterloo Co., Ont., Oct. 1, 1916; died of cancer at Kitchener, Ont., July 24, 1987; aged 70 y. On June 12, 1940, she was married to Delton Marti
2 CONC n, who survives. Also surviving are 2 daughters (Janice Cressman and Isobel Frey), one son (Kenneth), 10 grandchildren, and 2 sisters (Almeda Snider and Doris Bowman). She was a member of Floradale Mennonite Church, where funeral 
2 CONC services were held on July 26, in charge of J. Lester Kehl; interment in Floradale Church Cemetery.
