1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Good.-Elizabeth Ann, daughter of Cranson and Violet (Shantz) Good, was born May 21, 1943; passed away at the Hospital for Sick Children, Toronto, Ont., June 24, 1947; aged 4 y. 1 m. 3 d. Surviving are her parents, 
2 CONC one sister (Kathryn Violet), her grandparents (Mr. and Mrs. Benjamin Shantz, Freeport; and Mr. and Mrs. Abraham Good, Petersburg, Ont.), and a number of other relatives and many friends. Funeral services were conducted June 27 at 
2 CONC the Geiger Mennonite Church, New Hamburg, Ont., in charge of Curtis Cressman, assisted by Manasseh Hallman. Burial was made in the adjoining cemetery.
