2 CONT Burkholder, Amos Ressor, son of the late Abraham and Elizabeth (Ressor) Burkholder; born Nov. 17, 1884, Markham, Ont.; died suddenly Aug. 21, 1958, after a heart attack; aged 73y. 9 m. 4 d. Member of the Cedar Grove church, where 
2 CONC he served as deacon since 1934. Married Dec. 18, 1907, to Fanny Weber, who died in 1953. Survivors: 2 sons and 3 daughters (Walter, Pickering, Ont.; Mary-Mrs. Aaron Good, Petersburg, Ont.; Leonard, Markham, Ont.; Hannah-Mrs. Gordo
2 CONC n Wideman, Claremont, Ont.; and Ada, Ealesham, Alta.), 16 grandchildren, and one sister (Adah-Mrs. Noah Weber, Waterloo, Ont.). Funeral services Aug. 24 at the Wideman Church, conducted by Emerson McDowell, Aaron Grove, and George
2 CONC  Elsasser; interment in adjoining cemetery.
