2 CONT Burkholder, Leonard W., son of Amos and Fanny (Weber) Burkholder, was born on Feb. 16, 1916; died suddenly of a heart attack at his home near Markham, Ont., Feb. 27, 1974; aged 58 y. 11 d. On September 26, 1945, he was married to 
2 CONC Evelyn Byer, who survives. Also surviving are 6 daughters (Kristine-Mrs. Stan Nissley, Louise-Mrs. Dave Wideman, Eleanor, Betti, Marie, and Elfreda), 2 sons (George and Charles), one brother (Walter), and 3 sisters (Mary-Mrs. Aaro
2 CONC n Good, Hannah-Mrs. Gordon Wideman, and Ada-Mrs. Philip Barg). He was a member of the Cedar Grove Mennonite Church. Funeral services were held at the Wideman Mennonite Church on Mar. 2, in charge of Glen Brubacher and Emerson McDo
2 CONC well; interment in the Cedar Grove Mennonite Cemetery.
