1 NOTE {geni:about_me} WIDEMAN, Hannah Of Cambridge, Ontario. Passed away peacefully into the arms of her loving Lord and Saviour at Fairview Mennonite Home on Sunday, August 15, 2010, in her 88th year. Beloved wife of the late Gordon Wi
