1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Buehler, Norman, son of Abraham and Nancy (Moyer) Buehler, was born in Waterloo Co., Ont., Aug. 18, 1905; died at his home on June 15, 1980; aged 74 y. On Dec. 12, 1931, he was married to Ada Habermehl, who died on
2 CONC  Jan. 14, 1971. On June 10, 1972, he was married to Alice Horst, who survives. Also surviving are 3 sons (Floyd, Murray, and Vincent), one daughter (Verda Cook), one brother (Allan), and one sister (Maggie Metzger). He was a membe
2 CONC r of Elmira Mennonite Church, where funeral services were held on June 18, in charge of Vernon Leis and Marvin Shank; interment in St. Jacobs Mennonite Church Cemetery.
