2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Marx Oberholtzer and five of his brothers emmigrated from the Zurich area of Switzerland in 1657 to the Palatinate area of Germany.  He and two of his brothers are listed as Anabaptists.  There is a record of him attending an Anab
2 CONC aptist worship service back in Zurich in 1661.  Hmarried Margaret after May 21, 1660 Six children are known to have been born to the couple.
