1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Maria Barbara Oberholtzer was born on 25 June 1750, in Brecknock Township, Lancaster, Pennsylvania, United States, her father, Jacob Frey Oberholtzer, was 46 and her mother, Barbara Kilheffer, was 45. She marr
2 CONC ied Abraham Groff Martin in 1770, in Lancaster, Pennsylvania, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. She died in 1816, in her hometown, at the age of 66, and was buried in buried in Martin’s Cemet
2 CONC ery Denver, Lancaster, Pennsylvania, United States.
2 CONT
