2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Nash BIRTH	18 Jan 1753 DEATH	7 Aug 1829 (aged 76) BURIAL	 Deep Run Mennonite Church East Cemetery Bedminster, Bucks County, Pennsylvania, USA MEMORIAL ID	24326456 
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of William Colley Nash and Agnes (Fretz) Kolb. Husband of Elizabeth Wismer. Farmer, Weaver and deacon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Purchased land in Bucks County Tinnicum Township in 1776 from Robert Patterson. Converted to Mennonite Deacon.  Buried at Deep Run Mennonite Cemetary.
