2 CONC  C Cannuff Sept 15 1879 PO Norwich Ont No issue
2 CONT
2 CONT V Sarah Jane Wismer bn in York Co Ont Apr 13 1838 Mrd John Balthurst Burk Oct 23 1853 PO Brougham Ont Formerly blacksmith now farmer Ch of England Children
2 CONT
