1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/20202909/elizabeth-daub Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 17 2021, 13:36:02 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT The sixth of seven children, Elizabeth was the youngest daughter of Jacob Groff and Elizabeth Huebner.  Born and raised in Upper Salford, Elizabeth married George Daub, also of Montgomery County.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth and George lived near Salfordville.  After George died, Elizabeth, widow, kept house near Schwenksville, Upper Salford Township; living with her was William Daub, a farm laborer.  Elizabeth survived her husband by 25 yea
2 CONC rs and lived to age 99.
