1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth was the fifth of 11 children born to Heinrich Groff and his wife Scharlota Schwartz.  Heinrich Groff's will dated 1815 mentions his daughter Elizabeth intermarried with John Donehower.  The couple probabl
2 CONC y married in 1809 when Elizabeth was 18; he was eight years older.  The newlyweds list a young son in the 1810 census.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth lived 32 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Dannehauer is buried next to his wife Elisabeth, who is buried next to her parents Heinrich and Charlotta (nee Schwartz) Groff.
