2 CONT
2 CONT OBITUARY: Montgomery Ledger, Pottstown, Pennsylvania, January, 30, 1883, page 3.
2 CONT Thomas-At Mingo Station, Montgomery County, Friday morning. Jan 26, Abel Thomas aged 54 years, 1 month, and 1day.
2 CONT The relatives and friends are respectfully invited to attend the funeral from his late residence at Mingo Station, this county, on Thursday February 1st, 1883 at 10 o'clock am. Services at the house and at St. Lunes Church, Trappe
2 CONC . Interment at Cemetery connected with St. Lukes Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT OBITUARY: Montgomery Ledger, Jan 30, 1883, page 3.
2 CONT Abel Thomas, a well known citizen of Upper Providence, Montgomery County, died on Friday morning, at his residence at Mingo Station after a lingering illness, of cancer in the stomach. He was 54 years of age. Deceased was a miller
2 CONC  and farmer by occupation, and was one of the directors of the Mechanic's National Bank of Phoenixville.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Thanks to Ellie Thomas for providing the above obituaries.)* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/19340052/abel-thomas Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 2 2022, 2
