2 CONT A Brief History of Jacob Wismer and a Complete Genealogical Family Register With Biographies of His Descendants from the Earliest Available Records to the Present Time By A J Fretz, Eli Wismer 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=nwBgAAAAMAAJ 
2 CONT
2 CONT Page xiii, 7, 139, 144, 145, 179
2 CONT
2 CONT I. Jacob Wismer, (...) was born in Germany about 1684, and died in Bedminster Township, Bucks Co., Pa., Feb. 4, 1787 in his one hundred and third year. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (...) 
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Jacob and Nanny Wismer, as near in the order of birth as could be placed were: ---Jacob, Mary, Elizabeth, Joseph, Henry, Mark, Daniel, John, Christian, Nanny, Abraham.
2 CONT
2 CONT II. Henry Wismer, bn. in Bucks Co., Pa., about 1730; died ---. Mrd. Barbara Lederach in 1754. The children of Henry and Barbara Wismer are as follows: Jacob, Abraham, Annie, Maria, Henry, Joseph, Christian, Esther, John, Elizabeth
2 CONC , Samuel, Barbara.
2 CONT
2 CONT III. Abraham Wismer, bn. in Bucks Co., Nov. 5, 1756; died in 1844, aged 87 y. 3 m. 27 d. Mrd. Veronica Myers, —. She was bn. Apr. 3, 1757; died about 1818. Mrd second wife Mary, a widow of Detweiler (maiden name Freed). Farmer. Me
2 CONC nn. ch. Children: Henry, Samuel, Isaac, Barbara, Catharine, Veronica, Abraham, Elizabeth, Esther.
2 CONT
2 CONT IV. Esther Wismer, bn. Feb. 8, 1797; died Feb. 5, 1877. Mrd. Jacob Bergey, July 15, 1814. Children: Abraham, Susan, Jacob, John, Anna.
2 CONT
2 CONT V. Abraham Bergey, bn. Aug. 30, 1815; died Nov. 8. 1888. Mrd. Anna Kile, —. She was born Aug. 30, 1817; died Mar. 19, 1860. Farmer. Menn's. Children: Anna, Mary, Jacob, James, Oliver, Susanna, etc. —Mrd. second wife, Mary Gross, —
2 CONC ; she died —. No issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT VI. Anna Bergey, bn. Apr. 21, 1843; died June 16, 1891. Mrd. John Godshalk, —. Farmer. Menn's. Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT VII. Samuel B. Godshalk, bn. Feb. 25, 1880; died Aug. 7. 1881.
2 CONT
2 CONT VII. Isaiah B. Godshalk, bn. May 29, 1881; died June 9, 1882.
2 CONT
2 CONT VII. Isaac B. Godshalk, bn. Oct. 23, 1882; died July 24, 1885.
2 CONT
2 CONT VII. Jacob B. Godshalk, bn. Mar. 24, 1884; died Aug. 16, 1886.
2 CONT
2 CONT VII. Daniel B. Godshalk, bn. Jan. 1, 1886.
2 CONT
2 CONT VII. Harvey B. Godshalk, bn. Sept. 19, 1887; died Dec. 8, 1887.
