2 CONT
2 CONT V. Abraham Bergey, bn. Aug. 30, 1815; died Nov. 8. 1888. Mrd. Anna Kile, —. She was born Aug. 30, 1817; died Mar. 19, 1860. Farmer. Menn's. Children: Anna, Mary, Jacob, James, Oliver, Susanna, etc. —Mrd. second wife, Mary Gross, —
