1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT 4.173.  Michael Dirstine of Rockhill, Miller.
1 CONT February 8, 1777.  Proved January 23, 1782.
1 CONT Son Isaac and son-in-law Jacob Meyer, exrs.
1 CONT Son Abraham.
1 CONT Grandson Michael Dirstine, son of son Jacob, December'd.
1 CONT Daus. Barbara wife of Jacob Meyer, Elizabeth wife of Samuel Delp,
1 CONT Sarah wife of Peter Seller, and Hannah Dirstine.
1 CONT Wit: Lewis Stannert, John Stannert.
1 CONT
